    "verdict_notes": "The reader's 'tests'/T3 call and V1 limits_scope label are dropped: the data cannot show a double-descent peak. Values are best-regularization results from Table 6. Hyperparameters were chosen by mean Opt. F1 across the cross-validation folds, which appear to be the test folds, so the scores are likely optimistic. The TinyCNN and ResNet18 baselines (<1M and 11M parameters) also reportedly fit the training data, so they do not supply a below-threshold point."
